<div class="doc-info" id="now">
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Now.</strong> <a class="doc-link" href="[% c.uri_for('/todo/details') %]?record_id=2585">#2585</a> is done. Under 640px the hamburger toggles <code>nav-open</code> and taps open accordions. Wider than that the menu wraps and hover still works. JavaScript does not write inline <code>display</code> on menu nodes. Verified on port 4012, not 3001.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Blocked by.</strong> Nothing for the menu. The admin info-bar collapse (<a class="doc-link" href="[% c.uri_for('/todo/details') %]?record_id=2586">#2586</a>) is not started. Missing <code>sunfire.css</code> is owned by Theme Management, todo <a class="doc-link" href="[% c.uri_for('/todo/details') %]?record_id=2588">#2588</a> on project #77 — not absorbed here.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Next.</strong> Hard-refresh a page on port 4012 and narrow the window below 640px. Then <a class="doc-link" href="[% c.uri_for('/todo/details') %]?record_id=2586">#2586</a>.</p>
</div>

